    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels empty now. i used to have so much to say, so much to build, but it’s like the part of me that actually mattered just... died. i look at my old work and it feels like it was written by a stranger. now i'm just taking up space, waiting for nothing. it's like there's nothing left inside me worth saving.",
